    ▫ Standardize using "path" / "path" and string paths, not Path paths

  Additional Optimizations:
    ▫ Allow things to run in paralell within docker containers by separating different data_dir pipelines by using the unique name in metadata
    ▫ Run ultralytics on CUDA instead of CPU

